{"id": "1f9ae7c6-c6a2-48b7-a767-3420b7782f5b", "slug": "wireless-control-app-flow-1", "title": "Wireless Control App Flow", "description": "Wireless Control Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Wireless Control App Flow\"\ndescription: \"Wireless Control Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#EAB308\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#1E1E1E\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Wireless Control App Flow\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 13; favorites: 9; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nWireless Control Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nSkip Main Desk Rig Wireless Surface Drive your workstation pointer instantly through low-latency network protocols. Continue 76% Lounge Setup Master Audio Calibrate your global sound output seamlessly across localized a…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Wireless Surface; Master Audio.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #EAB308, background #0A0A0A, surface #1E1E1E, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Wireless Control App Flow</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify Solar Linear Icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP for Animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-transparent text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 relative selection:bg-slate-900 selection:text-white overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Fullscreen WebGL Laser Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-laser-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Layout Container (Framing styling removed, layout preserved) -->\n    <div id=\"devices-container\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1000px] mx-auto p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-16 gap-8 sm:gap-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Mobile Screen 1: Trackpad Module -->\n        <div class=\"mobile-device relative bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[2.5rem] flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-white w-full max-w-[360px] aspect-[390/844] shadow-2xl isolate border-[6px] border-[#0a0a0a] group transform transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%); box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n\n            <!-- Hardware Notch -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-6 bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-b-2xl z-50\"></div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n            <canvas id=\"webgl-bg-1\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- App Bar / Progress -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 w-full px-6 pt-10 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                    <div class=\"h-1 w-8 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"h-1 w-8 bg-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"text-white/50 text-xs font-normal uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-white transition-colors\">Skip</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mobile-Native Graphic (Trackpad Surface Representation) -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow mt-4 flex flex-col justify-center items-center w-full\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                <div class=\"w-[75%] aspect-square bg-[#121212] rounded-[2rem] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-[0_20px_40px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] border border-white/5\" style=\"transform: rotateX(25deg); transform-style: preserve-3d; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1f1f1f 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);\">\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-white/0 via-white/5 to-white/0 pointer-events-none z-30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 z-0\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 8px 8px;\"></div>\n                    <canvas id=\"webgl-screen-1\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-50\"></canvas>\n\n                    <!-- Active Area Indicator with Border Gradient -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto mb-4 mx-4 p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent z-20 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-lg\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1e1e1e]/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[15px] p-2.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mouse-linear\" class=\"text-sm text-white/80\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex-grow bg-white/5 rounded-full py-1.5 px-3 text-center overflow-hidden\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 truncate\">Main Desk Rig</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Sheet Content & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 mt-auto bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent pt-16 pb-8 px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-white/10\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:laptop-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"reveal-text text-xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-tight text-white mb-2\">\n                    Wireless Surface\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"reveal-text text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[240px]\">\n                    Drive your workstation pointer instantly through low-latency network protocols.\n                </p>\n                <button class=\"w-full bg-white text-slate-900 py-3.5 rounded-full font-normal text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors\">\n                    Continue\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mobile Screen 2: Volume Control Module -->\n        <div class=\"mobile-device relative bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[2.5rem] flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-white w-full max-w-[360px] aspect-[390/844] shadow-2xl isolate border-[6px] border-[#0a0a0a] group transform transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%); box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n\n            <!-- Hardware Notch -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-6 bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-b-2xl z-50\"></div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n            <canvas id=\"webgl-bg-2\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- App Bar / Progress -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 w-full px-6 pt-10 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                    <div class=\"h-1 w-8 bg-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"h-1 w-8 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Mobile-Native Graphic (Floating UI) -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow mt-4 flex flex-col justify-center items-center w-full\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n\n                <!-- The Floating Control Bar with Border Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-30 w-[85%] p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/30 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-[0_30px_60px_-10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),_0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:translate-z-10\" style=\"transform: rotate(-4deg) rotateY(-8deg) translateZ(60px); transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#1a1a1a]/95 backdrop-blur-xl w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:volume-loud-linear\" class=\"text-white text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"h-2.5 flex-grow bg-black/50 rounded-full shadow-inner relative overflow-visible border border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[76%] rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6 0%, #22c55e 33%, #eab308 66%, #f97316 100%);\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[110%] h-[400%] opacity-20 blur-xl pointer-events-none rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6 0%, #22c55e 33%, #eab308 66%, #f97316 100%); mix-blend-mode: screen;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white tracking-wide\">76%</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Contextual Nav behind floating bar -->\n                <div class=\"mt-8 bg-[#1e1e1e]/60 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full p-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border border-white/5 w-[65%] z-20\" style=\"transform: rotateX(20deg) scale(0.95); opacity: 0.8;\">\n                    <button class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rewind-back-linear\" class=\"text-xs text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow bg-white/5 rounded-full py-1.5 px-3 text-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-white/80\">Lounge Setup</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:forward-linear\" class=\"text-xs text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Sheet Content & Actions -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 mt-auto bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent pt-16 pb-8 px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-5 border border-white/10\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:soundwave-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"reveal-text text-xl font-normal tracking-tight leading-tight text-white mb-2\">\n                    Master Audio\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"reveal-text text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[240px]\">\n                    Calibrate your global sound output seamlessly across localized access points.\n                </p>\n                <button class=\"w-full bg-blue-600 text-white py-3.5 rounded-full font-normal text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20\">\n                    Pair Hardware\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Initialization Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n            // Masked Reveal Setup\n            function splitTextForReveal(selector) {\n                const elements = document.querySelectorAll(selector);\n                elements.forEach(el => {\n                    const text = el.innerText;\n                    const words = text.split(' ');\n                    el.innerHTML = '';\n                    words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                        const wordSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                        wordSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        wordSpan.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                        wordSpan.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                        const space = i < words.length - 1 ? '&nbsp;' : '';\n\n                        const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                        innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        innerSpan.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                        innerSpan.className = 'word-inner';\n                        innerSpan.innerHTML = word + space;\n\n                        wordSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                        el.appendChild(wordSpan);\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n\n            splitTextForReveal('.reveal-text');\n\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Animate mobile UI containers sequentially\n            gsap.from(\".mobile-device\", {\n                y: 60,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#devices-container\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Trigger internal card animations\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.group');\n            cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                const wordInners = card.querySelectorAll('.word-inner');\n                gsap.to(wordInners, {\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    stagger: 0.03,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: card,\n                        start: \"top 85%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                    }\n                });\n\n                const p3dElements = card.querySelectorAll('[style*=\"preserve-3d\"]');\n                gsap.from(p3dElements, {\n                    y: 30,\n                    opacity: 0,\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    delay: 0.3,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: card,\n                        start: \"top 80%\",\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Background WebGL Laser setup\n            function initLaserWebGL(canvasId) {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                if (!canvas) return;\n\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: false, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n                const uniforms = {\n                    u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() }\n                };\n\n                const fragmentShader = `\n                    uniform float u_time;\n                    uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n\n                    float hash(vec2 p) {\n                        return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                    }\n                    float noise(vec2 p) {\n                        vec2 i = floor(p);\n                        vec2 f = fract(p);\n                        f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                        float a = hash(i);\n                        float b = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n                        float c = hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n                        float d = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n                        return mix(mix(a, b, f.x), mix(c, d, f.x), f.y);\n                    }\n                    float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                        float v = 0.0;\n                        float a = 0.5;\n                        for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                            v += a * noise(p);\n                            p *= 2.0;\n                            a *= 0.5;\n                        }\n                        return v;\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                        vec2 centeredUv = uv * 2.0 - 1.0;\n                        vec2 aspectUv = centeredUv;\n                        aspectUv.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                        float dist = abs(centeredUv.x);\n\n                        // Thin crisp core\n                        float core = exp(-dist * 800.0);\n\n                        // Derived brand color halo (Blue to complement the Pair Hardware button)\n                        vec3 brandColor = vec3(0.145, 0.388, 0.922);\n                        vec3 haloColor = mix(brandColor, vec3(0.5, 0.7, 1.0), 0.2);\n\n                        float halo = exp(-dist * 12.0) * 0.7;\n                        halo += exp(-dist * 3.0) * 0.3;\n                        halo *= 0.85 + 0.15 * sin(u_time * 1.5);\n\n                        // Soft drifting smoke\n                        vec2 smokeUv = aspectUv * 2.5;\n                        smokeUv.y -= u_time * 0.15;\n                        float n = fbm(smokeUv + vec2(sin(u_time * 0.2) * 0.5, 0.0));\n\n                        float smokeFalloff = smoothstep(1.0, 0.0, dist);\n                        float smoke = n * smokeFalloff * 0.8;\n\n                        // Dark atmospheric background scene\n                        vec3 bgColor = vec3(0.02, 0.03, 0.05);\n\n                        vec3 finalColor = bgColor + (vec3(1.0) * core) + (haloColor * halo) + (haloColor * smoke);\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const vertexShader = `\n                    void main() {\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                    vertexShader,\n                    fragmentShader,\n                    uniforms,\n                    depthWrite: false\n                });\n\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                scene.add(mesh);\n\n                function resize() {\n                    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                    uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                }\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n                resize();\n\n                const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n                function animate() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n                animate();\n            }\n\n            // Existing Screen Background WebGL Setup\n            function initWebGL(canvasId, shaderType) {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                if (!canvas) return;\n\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n                const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n                const uniforms = {\n                    u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() }\n                };\n\n                let fragmentShader;\n\n                if (shaderType === 'rings') {\n                    fragmentShader = `\n                        uniform float u_time;\n                        uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                        void main() {\n                            vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                            st.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n                            vec2 center = vec2(0.5 * (u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y), 0.5);\n                            float d = distance(st, center);\n                            float rings = sin(d * 40.0 - u_time * 1.5);\n                            rings = smoothstep(0.9, 1.0, rings);\n                            float fade = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.1, 0.8, d);\n                            gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(0.8), rings * fade * 0.15);\n                        }\n                    `;\n                } else if (shaderType === 'pulseMatrix') {\n                    fragmentShader = `\n                        uniform float u_time;\n                        uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                        void main() {\n                            vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                            float line = smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, sin(st.y * 10.0 - u_time * 3.0));\n                            float alpha = line * 0.05 * (1.0 - st.y);\n                            gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(1.0), alpha);\n                        }\n                    `;\n                } else if (shaderType === 'particles') {\n                    fragmentShader = `\n                        uniform float u_time;\n                        uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                        float random (in vec2 _st) {\n                            return fract(sin(dot(_st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                        }\n                        void main() {\n                            vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                            st.y += u_time * 0.05;\n                            vec2 grid = floor(st * 30.0);\n                            float rnd = random(grid);\n                            float alpha = 0.0;\n                            if(rnd > 0.95) {\n                                vec2 fractSt = fract(st * 30.0);\n                                float d = distance(fractSt, vec2(0.5));\n                                alpha = smoothstep(0.4, 0.1, d) * (0.5 + 0.5*sin(u_time*2.0 + rnd*10.0));\n                            }\n                            float fade = smoothstep(0.0, 0.3, st.y) * smoothstep(1.0, 0.7, st.y);\n                            gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(1.0), alpha * fade * 0.3);\n                        }\n                    `;\n                }\n\n                const vertexShader = `\n                    void main() {\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `;\n\n                const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                    vertexShader,\n                    fragmentShader,\n                    uniforms,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    depthWrite: false\n                });\n\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                scene.add(mesh);\n\n                function resize() {\n                    const rect = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    renderer.setSize(rect.width, rect.height);\n                    uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(rect.width, rect.height);\n                }\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n                resize();\n\n                const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n                function animate() {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    uniforms.u_time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                }\n\n                animate();\n            }\n\n            // Initialize all WebGL instances\n            initLaserWebGL('webgl-laser-bg');\n            initWebGL('webgl-bg-1', 'rings');\n            initWebGL('webgl-screen-1', 'pulseMatrix');\n            initWebGL('webgl-bg-2', 'particles');\n\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "wireless-control-app-flow-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/wireless-control-app-flow-1.jpg", "source_name": "wireless-control-app-flow-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 111, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T02:41:53.530184+00:00"}